{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2019-11-18 22:30:00', 'title': 'INTERPUBLIC GROUP DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 16, 2019', 'text': 'INTERPUBLIC GROUP ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY’S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON IPG COMMON STOCK OF $0.235 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 16, 2019, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 2, 2019.'}